	(text "Host (I2C 0x24): write Output Port 1 (03h) bit 5 = 0 FIRST (default 1 = on!),\nthen Configuration Port 1 (07h) = DFh (P1.5 output, the rest inputs).\nOn: 03h bit 5 = 1.  Off: 03h bit 5 = 0.  Read Input Port 1 (01h):\nbit 5 = 6V_EN as driven, bit 6 = /FLT6V (0 = fault), bit 7 = 6V_PG (1 = outlet live)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320.04 452.12 0)
